### GET - GENERATE TOKEN
GET {{host}}/generate-token

### POST - LOGIN
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": {{email}},
  "password": {{password}}
}

### POST - REGISTER (phase 2 with metadata)
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": {{email}},
  "password": {{password}},
  "profile": {
    "full_name": "Example User"
  }
}

### GET - VERIFY
GET {{host}}/verify
Authorization: {{token}}

### GET - SAMPLE REQUEST WITH TOKEN
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: {{token}}

### GET - REFRESH
GET {{host}}/refresh